optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  -s SEQ, --seq SEQ     Protein sequence to be annotated. (default: None)
  -cm CMAP, --cmap CMAP
                        Protein contact map to be annotated (in *npz file
                        format). (default: None)
  -pdb PDB_FN, --pdb_fn PDB_FN
                        Protein PDB file to be annotated. (default: None)
  --cmap_csv CMAP_CSV   Catalogue with chain to file path mapping. (default:
                        None)
  --pdb_dir PDB_DIR     Directory with PDB files of predicted Rosetta/DMPFold
                        structures. (default: None)
  --fasta_fn FASTA_FN   Fasta file with protein sequences. (default: None)
  --model_config MODEL_CONFIG
                        JSON file with model names. (default:
                        ./trained_models/model_config.json)
  -ont {mf,bp,cc,ec} [{mf,bp,cc,ec} ...], --ontology {mf,bp,cc,ec} [{mf,bp,cc,ec} ...]
                        Gene Ontology/Enzyme Commission. (default: ['mf'])
  -o OUTPUT_FN_PREFIX, --output_fn_prefix OUTPUT_FN_PREFIX
                        Save predictions/saliency in file. (default: DeepFRI)
  -v, --verbose         Prints predictions. (default: False)
  --use_guided_grads    Use guided grads to compute gradCAM. (default: False)
  --saliency            Compute saliency maps for every protein and every MF-
                        GO term/EC number. (default: False)
